# Local agent tooling, deliberately untracked.
#
# `.wolf` and `.opencode` are written and rewritten by their CLIs — session
# state, token ledgers, scan caches and vendored hook scripts — so tracking
# them means a diff on every session and lint errors in code that is not ours.
# `CLAUDE.md` and `.claude` are one contributor's assistant configuration, not
# a project convention every contributor has to adopt. All four were swept in
# by a broad `git add` on 2026-08-27; none had ever been tracked before.
.wolf/
.opencode/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.superpowers

# Playwright MCP screenshots/logs
.playwright-mcp/

# internal launch material, never published
.internal/
